From d4d2f03d2a1c648a5038b127dc77228436eda71f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:58:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] capture: NX2NAVI_CAPTURE=<present> or NX2NAVI_CAPTURE_REQ=1
 (capture.req, default off) writes one frame at the back end's interface
 (pools, slots, GPU-written images, the queue state, each submission's
 flattened op stream with the objects it points at, the shadow sync's guest
 bytes) to capture/f<N>/cap.bin; nx2navi --replay <dir> runs it without the
 game, with draw filters (NX2NAVI_REPLAY_SKIP/_ONLY/_PER_DRAW), buffer
 snapshots (NX2NAVI_REPLAY_BUF), draws.txt and a comparison with the captured
 picture

---
 runtime/host.h       |   1 +
 runtime/main.c       |   7 +-
 runtime/vk.h         |  17 +
 runtime/vk_backend.c |  22 +-
 runtime/vk_capture.c | 999 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 runtime/vk_exec.c    |  32 ++
 runtime/vk_exec.h    |   3 +
 runtime/vk_memory.c  |  36 ++
 runtime/vk_texture.c |  19 +
 9 files changed, 1132 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 runtime/vk_capture.c

