+// ---- frame capture and standalone replay (vk_capture.c). NX2NAVI_CAPTURE=<present> or NX2NAVI_CAPTURE_REQ=1
+// (capture.req beside the shader cache) writes one frame; nx2navi --replay <capture dir> runs it without the game.
